",\"data\":{\"section_title\":\"Wat \\u003cspan class=\\u0022text-color-secondary\\u0022\\u003eTechnoSapiens\\u003c/span\\u003e voor je kan betekenen\",\"_section_title\":\"field_6c8d9e0f1a2b4\",\"title_heading_tag\":\"h2\",\"_title_heading_tag\":\"field_6c8d9e0f1a2b5\",\"cards_per_row\":\"3\",\"_cards_per_row\":\"field_6c8d9e0f1a2b6\",\"cards_0_card_title\":\"Websites en platform ontwikkeling\",\"_cards_0_card_title\":\"field_6c8d9e0f1a2b8\",\"cards_0_card_content\":\"Vergeet trage, saaie templates. TechnoSapiens bouwt een veilig en krachtig platform op maat van jouw merk—volledig afgestemd op de nieuwste CMS-technologieën.\",\"_cards_0_card_content\":\"field_6c8d9e0f1a2b9\",\"cards_0_card_link\":{\"title\":\"Vertel me meer\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_cards_0_card_link\":\"field_6c8d9e0f1a2ba\",\"cards_1_card_title\":\"Webapplicaties en AI workflows\",\"_cards_1_card_title\":\"field_6c8d9e0f1a2b8\",\"cards_1_card_content\":\"Heb je een complex vraagstuk? TechnoSapiens bouwt slimme applicaties met de modernste technieken en handige AI-workflows. Zo versnelt jouw bedrijfsproces en groeit je organisatie moeiteloos door.\",\"_cards_1_card_content\":\"field_6c8d9e0f1a2b9\",\"cards_1_card_link\":{\"title\":\"Dat wil ik!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_cards_1_card_link\":\"field_6c8d9e0f1a2ba\",\"cards_2_card_title\":\" Technische sparringpartner en architect\",\"_cards_2_card_title\":\"field_6c8d9e0f1a2b8\",\"cards_2_card_content\":\"Loop je vast of wil je snel kunnen schakelen met een developer? Met ervaring als platform lead en innovatie-aanjager denkt TechnoSapiens direct mee over een robuust, toekomstbestendig digitaal plan.\",\"_cards_2_card_content\":\"field_6c8d9e0f1a2b9\",\"cards_2_card_link\":{\"title\":\"Ik wil meer weten\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_cards_2_card_link\":\"field_6c8d9e0f1a2ba\",\"cards\":3,\"_cards\":\"field_6c8d9e0f1a2b7\",\"section_margin_top\":\"mt-xl\",\"_section_margin_top\":\"field_6a4a4ab0b6dc0\",\"section_margin_bottom\":\"mb-lg\",\"_section_margin_bottom\":\"field_6156ab4c687e8\",\"section_vignet_top\":\"1\",\"_section_vignet_top\":\"field_6aaeef9d735d6\",\"section_vignet_bottom\":\"1\",\"_section_vignet_bottom\":\"field_6aaeefd2735d7\",\"background_type\":\"bands\",\"_background_type\":\"field_6aaef7702bdba\",\"background_bands_axis\":\"horizontal\",\"_background_bands_axis\":\"field_6aaef7c42bdbb\",\"background_bands_size\":\"large\",\"_background_bands_size\":\"field_6aaef84e3c58f\",\"background_bands_anim_dir\":\"top-bottom\",\"_background_bands_anim_dir\":\"field_6aaef8153c58e\"}} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-section-process-cards {\"name\":\"acf/section-section-process-cards\",\"data\":{\"section_title\":\"Hoe we \\u003cspan class=\\u0022text-color-primary\\u0022\\u003esamen\\u003c/span\\u003e tot het \\u003cspan class=\\u0022text-color-tertiary\\u0022\\u003ebeste\\u003c/span\\u003e resultaat komen\",\"_section_title\":\"field_7e8f0a1b2c3d5\",\"title_heading_tag\":\"h2\",\"_title_heading_tag\":\"field_7e8f0a1b2c3d6\",\"cards_0_card_title\":\"1. De kennismaking (Koffie of Bier?)\",\"_cards_0_card_title\":\"field_7e8f0a1b2c3d8\",\"cards_0_card_text\":\"We plannen een \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://technosapiens.test/contact/\\u0022\\u003emeeting\\u003c/a\\u003e om jouw ideeën te bespreken.\\r\\nWe kijken of de klik er is en leggen de fundering voor het project.\",\"_cards_0_card_text\":\"field_7e8f0a1b2c3d9\",\"cards_1_card_title\":\"2. Strategie \\u0026 Architectuur\",\"_cards_1_card_title\":\"field_7e8f0a1b2c3d8\",\"cards_1_card_text\":\"Jouw wensen worden omgezet in een helder, technisch plan. We ontwerpen een structuur die schaalbaar, slim en gebruiksvriendelijk is.\",\"_cards_1_card_text\":\"field_7e8f0a1b2c3d9\",\"cards_2_card_title\":\"3. Bouwen \\u0026 Innoveren\",\"_cards_2_card_title\":\"field_7e8f0a1b2c3d8\",\"cards_2_card_text\":\"Hier gebeurt de magie. Ik duik in de techniek en transformeer het plan naar een razendsnel, werkend platform. Tijdens dit proces houd ik je continu op de hoogte.\",\"_cards_2_card_text\":\"field_7e8f0a1b2c3d9\",\"cards_3_card_title\":\"4. Lancering en vieren\",\"_cards_3_card_title\":\"field_7e8f0a1b2c3d8\",\"cards_3_card_text\":\"Alles is uitgebreid getest.\\r\\nWe gaan live! Na de lancering blijft Techno Sapiens uiteraard in beeld voor optimalisatie en support. Tijd voor die\\r\\n(volgende) borrel.\",\"_cards_3_card_text\":\"field_7e8f0a1b2c3d9\",\"cards\":4,\"_cards\":\"field_7e8f0a1b2c3d7\",\"call_to_action\":{\"title\":\"Zullen we kennismaken?\",\"url\":\"https://technosapiens.test/contact/\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_call_to_action\":\"field_7e8f0a1b2c3da\",\"section_margin_top\":\"mt-xl\",\"_section_margin_top\":\"field_6a4a4ab0b6dc0\",\"section_margin_bottom\":\"mb-xl\",\"_section_margin_bottom\":\"field_6156ab4c687e8\",\"section_vignet_top\":\"1\",\"_section_vignet_top\":\"field_6aaeef9d735d6\",\"section_vignet_bottom\":\"1\",\"_section_vignet_bottom\":\"field_6aaeefd2735d7\",\"background_type\":\"bands\",\"_background_type\":\"field_6aaef7702bdba\",\"background_bands_axis\":\"vertical\",\"_background_bands_axis\":\"field_6aaef7c42bdbb\",\"background_bands_size\":\"xlarge\",\"_background_bands_size\":\"field_6aaef84e3c58f\",\"background_bands_anim_dir\":\"center\",\"_background_bands_anim_dir\":\"field_6aaef8153c58e\"}} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-section-brands {\"name\":\"acf/section-section-brands\",\"data\":{\"section_title\":\"Staat \\u003cspan class=\\u0022text-color-tertiary\\u0022\\u003ejouw logo\\u003c/span\\u003e hier straks ook bij?\",\"_section_title\":\"field_6d9e0f1a2b3c5\",\"title_heading_tag\":\"h2\",\"_title_heading_tag\":\"field_6d9e0f1a2b3c6\",\"brands_0_brand_logo\":244,\"_brands_0_brand_logo\":\"field_6d9e0f1a2b3c8\",\"brands_0_brand_link\":\"\",\"_brands_0_brand_link\":\"field_6d9e0f1a2b3c9\",\"brands_1_brand_logo\":273,\"_brands_1_brand_logo\":\"field_6d9e0f1a2b3c8\",\"brands_1_brand_link\":\"\",\"_brands_1_brand_link\":\"field_6d9e0f1a2b3c9\",\"brands_2_brand_logo\":298,\"