aande, ambachtelijke vakkennis met de nieuwste agentic AI-workflows om robuuste oplossingen te creëren voor taaie uitdagingen. Waarom ik dit doe? Omdat de zoektocht naar de best mogelijke innovatie mij de energie geeft om te blijven optimaliseren. Mijn doel is simpel: de nieuwste\\r\\n(AI-)ontwikkelingen zó inzetten dat ze zorgen voor een soepele, razendsnelle en betrokken digitale ervaring voor iedereen.\",\"_content_text\":\"field_7c5bd78cd0c80\",\"content_link\":{\"title\":\"Call to action\",\"url\":\"https://technosapiens.test/contact/\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_content_link\":\"field_7c5bd78cd0c83\",\"section_margin_top\":\"mt-xl\",\"_section_margin_top\":\"field_6a4a4ab0b6dc0\",\"section_margin_bottom\":\"mb-xl\",\"_section_margin_bottom\":\"field_6156ab4c687e8\",\"section_vignet_top\":\"1\",\"_section_vignet_top\":\"field_6aaeef9d735d6\",\"section_vignet_bottom\":\"1\",\"_section_vignet_bottom\":\"field_6aaeefd2735d7\",\"background_type\":\"\",\"_background_type\":\"field_6aaef7702bdba\"}} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-section-heading {\"name\":\"acf/section-section-heading\",\"data\":{\"title_text\":\"Staat \\u003cspan class=\\u0022text-color-tertiary\\u0022\\u003ejouw logo\\u003c/span\\u003e hier straks ook bij?\",\"_title_text\":\"field_6aaee8e9340f4\",\"title_heading_tag\":\"h2\",\"_title_heading_tag\":\"field_6aaeea7128b01\",\"title_heading_size\":\"h2\",\"_title_heading_size\":\"field_6ac6297dec0ff\",\"section_margin_top\":\"mt-lg\",\"_section_margin_top\":\"field_6a4a4ab0b6dc0\",\"section_margin_bottom\":\"\",\"_section_margin_bottom\":\"field_6156ab4c687e8\",\"section_vignet_top\":\"0\",\"_section_vignet_top\":\"field_6aaeef9d735d6\",\"section_vignet_bottom\":\"0\",\"_section_vignet_bottom\":\"field_6aaeefd2735d7\",\"background_type\":\"solid\",\"_background_type\":\"field_6aaef7702bdba\",\"background_color\":\"dark\",\"_background_color\":\"field_6ac62c5c21111\"}} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-section-brands {\"name\":\"acf/section-section-brands\",\"data\":{